flowchart TD
    Start([User visits login page]) --> Enter[Enter username & password]
    Enter --> Submit[Submit credentials]
    Submit --> Validate{Credentials valid?}
    Validate -->|No| Fail[Show error message]
    Fail --> Attempts{Too many failed attempts?}
    Attempts -->|Yes| Lock[Lock account]
    Attempts -->|No| Enter
    Validate -->|Yes| Session[Create session]
    Session --> Perms{Check permissions}
    Perms -->|Admin| AdminDash[Admin Dashboard]
    Perms -->|User| UserDash[User Dashboard]
    Perms -->|Read-only| Readonly[Read-only view]
